# Keys whose signature on a release's SHA256SUMS is accepted
# (ssh-keygen ALLOWED SIGNERS format; see deploy/release/sign.sh and
# docs/DEPLOYMENT.md, "Signing keys"). Two lines, both always present:
#   e-pages-release namespaces="e-pages-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAA... e-pages-release
#   e-pages-release namespaces="e-pages-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAA... e-pages-release-backup
# The everyday key signs every release; the backup key, kept offline, signs
# only the release that replaces a lost or leaked everyday key.
